        "TileImage": "$($repository 543aa136-c28a-41c4-918b-f75702fd06b5).Image",
        "Description": "Good news, 47.\r\rWe have found the leaders of the group hoping to expose the ICA. And even better: they&apos;re all attending the same event tonight. They are people of high society, some of which have previously paid for our services. Your targets are Ark Society members Amos Dexter and Jason Portman, along with architects Paul V. Lumpkin and Malcolm Hughes. Eliminate them, and the ICA remains a secret to the rest of the world.\r\rI&apos;ll give you time to prepare.",
